{"version":1,"content":"<p>林子祥與葉蒨文早前（11日）在重慶舉行《白頭到老WE ARE ONE演唱會》期間險生意外，葉蒨文演繹歌曲《I Believe in Love》時，因忘我跳舞差點跌落台，幸得身旁的舞蹈員出手相救才化險為夷。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T06:22:22.870536+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":102,"images":0,"source":"明報 娛樂","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T05:33:02+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T22:38:04.523943+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T06:17:46.024978+00:00","content_hash":"134954a6049c422056ca28ffac84132b158b612914b67215e5cfdcc35d618571","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}